WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:09.133
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.133 --> 00:10.933
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.933 --> 00:12.400
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.400 --> 00:14.567
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.567 --> 00:17.400
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.400 --> 00:19.500
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.500 --> 00:21.500
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.500 --> 00:23.400
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.400 --> 00:25.033
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.033 --> 00:27.533
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.533 --> 00:29.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.367 --> 00:31.467
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.467 --> 00:33.500
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.500 --> 00:35.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.367 --> 00:37.700
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.700 --> 00:39.633
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.633 --> 00:40.967
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:42.833
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.833 --> 00:45.567
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.567 --> 00:47.867
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:47.867 --> 00:49.367
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.900 --> 00:54.900
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:54.900 --> 01:01.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:01.067 --> 01:02.767
- We interrupt this program
- 我们中断这个程序

01:02.767 --> 01:06.600
to bring you
a Bikini Bottom News Flash.
给你带来
比基尼泳裤新闻快讯。

01:06.600 --> 01:08.067
- [neighs]
- Whoa, big fella.
- [嘶嘶声]
- 哇，大家伙。

01:08.067 --> 01:10.067
- Mr. Plankton,
we've received word
- 浮游生物先生，
我们已收到消息

01:10.067 --> 01:12.567
that you're plotting
to infiltrate the Krusty Krab
你正在策划的
潜入蟹堡王

01:12.567 --> 01:15.067
and steal the Krabby Patty
secret formula.
并偷走蟹黄饼
秘密配方。

01:15.067 --> 01:16.400
Is that true?
这是真的吗？

01:16.400 --> 01:18.467
- Actually, yes, that is true.
- 事实上，是的，确实如此。

01:18.467 --> 01:19.767
I've got it all worked out.
我已经把一切都解决了。

01:19.767 --> 01:23.067
First I break into the safe
and--ehh.
首先我闯入保险箱
还有——呃。

01:23.067 --> 01:25.133
Wait, is this live?
等等，这是直播吗？

01:25.133 --> 01:28.133
- Yes.
- 是的。

01:28.133 --> 01:30.933
- Don't broadcast
my secret plans!
- 请勿广播
我的秘密计划！

01:30.933 --> 01:33.600
They're secret!
他们是秘密的！

01:33.600 --> 01:36.600
I will destroy
all of you!
我会摧毁
你们所有人！

01:36.600 --> 01:38.367
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

01:38.367 --> 01:41.900
Secret formula, ho!
秘密配方，呵呵！

01:41.900 --> 01:44.667
- [neighs]
- [嘶嘶声]

01:44.667 --> 01:47.633
- I reckon that classified
taste mixture
- 我认为这属于机密
味道混合物

01:47.633 --> 01:50.233
will be in my hands directly.
将直接在我手中。

01:50.233 --> 01:52.233
[inhales]
[吸气]

01:56.500 --> 01:59.500
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:59.500 --> 02:02.333
Ow!
噢！

02:02.333 --> 02:04.067
[laughs]
[笑]

02:04.067 --> 02:05.067
The fool!
傻瓜！

02:05.067 --> 02:07.567
He left the safe open.
他把保险箱打开了。

02:11.867 --> 02:14.433
Open for business, baby!
开门营业了，宝贝！

02:19.067 --> 02:20.067
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:20.067 --> 02:21.967
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:21.967 --> 02:23.900
Gotcha.
明白了。

02:28.867 --> 02:30.900
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

02:30.900 --> 02:33.100
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:33.100 --> 02:36.100
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

02:36.100 --> 02:37.233
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:37.233 --> 02:41.067
I'm off to make a delivery.
我要去送货了

02:41.067 --> 02:43.433
- Ha, that fool.
- 哈，那个傻瓜。

02:47.167 --> 02:49.667
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:49.667 --> 02:50.967
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

02:52.633 --> 02:57.567
And the Krabby Patty
is made of...
还有蟹黄饼
是由...制成的

02:57.567 --> 02:58.433
urchins!
顽童！

02:58.433 --> 03:00.167
- Ew! Ew!
- 呃！呃！

03:00.167 --> 03:02.633
- Gotcha!
[laughs]
- 明白了！
[笑]

03:04.933 --> 03:06.167
- [laughs maniacally]
- [疯狂地笑]

03:06.167 --> 03:07.167
Yoink!
哟哟！

03:07.167 --> 03:08.167
- Huh?
- 啊？

03:08.167 --> 03:10.367
- [laughing]
Yes!
- [笑]
是的！

03:10.367 --> 03:11.933
- Pull!
- 拉！

03:11.933 --> 03:13.333
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

03:13.333 --> 03:16.233
[laughs]
[笑]

03:16.233 --> 03:18.367
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

03:20.433 --> 03:23.600
[propeller whirring]
[螺旋桨呼呼地响]

03:23.600 --> 03:25.300
- [groans]
- Gotcha!
- [呻吟]
- 明白了！

03:25.300 --> 03:27.433
[laughs]
[笑]

03:28.333 --> 03:31.333
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

03:31.333 --> 03:38.333
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:38.333 --> 03:40.467
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:40.467 --> 03:42.600
[screaming]
[尖叫]

03:44.567 --> 03:47.067
- [laughs]
Gotcha.
- [笑]
明白了。

03:50.767 --> 03:52.800
- Alley-oop!
- 空中接力！

03:55.067 --> 03:57.767
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

03:57.767 --> 04:00.100
[gulps, belches]
[吞咽，打嗝]

04:00.100 --> 04:02.433
- Whee!
- 呼！

04:02.433 --> 04:05.533
Come to daddy, patty!
到爸爸那里来吧，帕蒂！

04:08.100 --> 04:09.400
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:09.400 --> 04:10.700
[straining]
[紧张]

04:10.700 --> 04:12.333
[laughs]
[笑]

04:12.333 --> 04:14.067
- Gotcha.
- 明白了。

04:14.067 --> 04:16.133
[laughs]
[笑]

04:18.900 --> 04:20.067
- Eeh.
- 呃。

04:20.067 --> 04:22.500
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

04:24.700 --> 04:26.633
[yells]
[喊叫]

04:28.767 --> 04:31.200
Oh, Karen,
he covered me in urchins,
哦，凯伦，
他用海胆覆盖我，

04:31.200 --> 04:34.100
fed me to a seahorse,
and stung me to death.
把我喂给海马，
并把我蜇死了。

04:34.100 --> 04:36.567
I fly through the air,
he flies through the air.
我在空中飞翔，
他在空中飞翔。

04:36.567 --> 04:39.100
I hide in a stomach,
he hides in a stomach.
我躲在肚子里
他藏在肚子里。

04:39.100 --> 04:41.467
I have had enough!
我已经受够了！

04:41.467 --> 04:46.167
- Oh, I think someone needs
their ba-ba.
- 哦，我想有人需要
他们的爸爸。

04:46.167 --> 04:48.933
There, isn't that better?
有了，那不是更好吗？

04:48.933 --> 04:50.433
- No, Karen!
- 不，凯伦！

04:50.433 --> 04:53.400
That's just not gonna
work anymore!
那只是不会
不再工作了！

04:53.400 --> 04:56.600
Don't you see?
We're done here.
你没看到吗？
我们到这里就完成了。

04:56.600 --> 04:58.967
- He said for
the 9 billionth time.
- 他说为了
第90亿次。

04:58.967 --> 05:00.900
You know, Sheldon,
if I had a dime
你知道，谢尔顿，
如果我有一毛钱

05:00.900 --> 05:03.733
for every time you--
[powers down]
每当你——
[断电]

05:05.767 --> 05:07.600
[cricket chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

05:12.100 --> 05:15.100
["Taps" plays]
[“点击”播放]

05:15.100 --> 05:22.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:32.567 --> 05:34.533
- Mr. Krabs,
did you see that?
- 蟹老板先生，
你看到了吗？

05:34.533 --> 05:35.933
Plankton is retiring.
浮游生物即将退休。

05:35.933 --> 05:38.533
- I'll believes it
when I sees it.
- 我会相信
当我看到它的时候。

05:45.400 --> 05:47.700
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

05:49.600 --> 05:51.933
- [grunts]
Hey, ha ha!
- [咕哝]
嘿嘿嘿！

05:53.267 --> 05:55.067
All hands on deck,
SpongeBob!
所有人都在甲板上，
海绵宝宝！

05:55.067 --> 05:56.967
Aye-aye, Mr--whoa!
是啊是啊，先生——哇！

05:56.967 --> 05:58.567
Oh-oh-oh!
哦哦哦！

05:58.567 --> 06:00.067
- [laughs]
- [笑]

06:00.067 --> 06:02.333
- Aw, you want to say
good-bye to Plankton,
- 噢，你想说
再见浮游生物，

06:02.333 --> 06:03.633
you old softy you.
你这个老软蛋。

06:03.633 --> 06:05.133
- That'll be the day.
- 那一天就会到来。

06:05.133 --> 06:08.067
I don't trust Plankton
as far as I throw him.
我不相信浮游生物
就我把他扔远了。

06:08.067 --> 06:10.567
That's why we're gonna
shadow that little twit
这就是为什么我们要
影子那个小家伙

06:10.567 --> 06:12.700
and find out what he's up to.
并找出他在做什么。

06:16.133 --> 06:17.633
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:20.200 --> 06:23.733
- "Welcome to Dullsville:
a charmingly boring--"
- “欢迎来到杜尔斯维尔：
令人着迷的无聊——”

06:23.733 --> 06:26.967
- Snap your trap, boy-o.
You'll blow our cover.
- 拉开你的陷阱，小伙子。
你会暴露我们的掩护。

06:29.667 --> 06:32.267
- A new life in a new town.
- 新城镇的新生活。

06:32.267 --> 06:34.733
[laughs]
[笑]

06:41.833 --> 06:44.200
- I still don't see Plankton
doing anything wrong.
- 我还是没有看到浮游生物
做任何错事。

06:44.200 --> 06:45.900
Maybe he really is retiring.
也许他真的要退休了。

06:45.900 --> 06:49.400
- Believes it
when I sees it.
- 相信它
当我看到它的时候。

06:49.400 --> 06:51.867
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

06:54.200 --> 07:00.733
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:00.733 --> 07:03.200
- Quick, boy,
he's getting away.
- 快点，男孩，
他要走了。

07:05.333 --> 07:07.500
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

07:07.500 --> 07:09.900
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

07:14.400 --> 07:16.067
[bell dings]
[铃声]

07:16.067 --> 07:18.900
- Yes?
- I'd like a room, please.
- 是的？
- 我想要一个房间。

07:18.900 --> 07:21.567
- Very good, sir.
- [groans]
- 很好，先生。
- [呻吟]

07:21.567 --> 07:24.433
- How long will you be
staying with us?
- 你会持续多久
和我们住在一起吗？

07:24.433 --> 07:27.567
- [groaning]
- [grumbles]
- [呻吟]
- [抱怨]

07:29.133 --> 07:30.267
Forever.
永远。

07:30.267 --> 07:32.167
Ahhh!
啊啊！

07:32.167 --> 07:34.100
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:43.900 --> 07:47.900
And so begins my retirement.
我的退休生活就这样开始了。

07:47.900 --> 07:50.300
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

07:50.300 --> 07:53.400
- You see you, lad.
Plankton is up to no good.
- 你看到你了，小伙子。
浮游生物不怀好意。

07:53.400 --> 07:57.100
I bet those are all the fixings
for another evil lab.
我打赌这些就是所有的配件
另一个邪恶的实验室。

07:57.100 --> 07:59.400
- Mr. Krabs,
I'm gonna be sick.
- 蟹老板先生，
我会生病的。

07:59.400 --> 08:00.633
- [laughs]
- [笑]

08:00.633 --> 08:02.167
Yes.
是的。

08:02.167 --> 08:04.133
Yes!
是的！

08:04.133 --> 08:07.633
- You see, he's got an evil belt
to match those evil shoes.
- 你看，他有一条邪恶的腰带
来搭配那些邪恶的鞋子。

08:16.067 --> 08:17.400
- Yes!
- 是的！

08:17.400 --> 08:20.400
My plan is almost complete.
我的计划快完成了。

08:20.400 --> 08:21.933
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

08:21.933 --> 08:24.233
- His plan!
Did you hear that, SpongeBob?
- 他的计划！
你听到了吗，海绵宝宝？

08:24.233 --> 08:25.900
He said plan!
他说计划！

08:25.900 --> 08:28.567
- Uh, please, don't shake me,
Mr. Krabs.
- 呃，请不要摇晃我，
蟹老板。

08:28.567 --> 08:30.767
- Oh, my pretty.
- 哦，我的美人。

08:30.767 --> 08:33.733
You'll be my best friend
from now on.
你会成为我最好的朋友
从现在开始。

08:33.733 --> 08:34.833
[laughs]
[笑]

08:34.833 --> 08:36.633
Retirement is mine.
退休是我的。

08:36.633 --> 08:37.700
Mine.
矿。

08:37.700 --> 08:40.500
Mine!
[laughs]
矿！
[笑]

08:40.500 --> 08:42.167
- Ooh, this is it, boy-o.
- 哦，就是这样，男孩。

08:42.167 --> 08:44.633
He's got an evil laser
death apparatus contraption
他有邪恶的激光
死亡装置装置

08:44.633 --> 08:46.367
ready to spring on all of us.
准备好向我们所有人扑来。

08:46.367 --> 08:48.300
- [laughs maniacally]
- [疯狂地笑]

08:51.333 --> 08:53.067
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:53.067 --> 08:54.467
- Ooh.
- 哦。

08:54.467 --> 08:55.667
[both yell]
[两人大喊]

08:55.667 --> 08:57.667
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

08:57.667 --> 09:00.333
Now that I sees it,
I believes it.
现在我看到了，
我相信。

09:00.333 --> 09:04.267
- Hurray! I knew you'd
get it, Mr. Krabs.
- 万岁！我就知道你会
明白了，蟹老板。

09:05.533 --> 09:07.133
[retching]
[干呕]

09:07.133 --> 09:08.333
- Krabs!
- 螃蟹！

09:08.333 --> 09:11.100
What are you doing
in my hotel room?
你在做什么
在我的酒店房间里？

09:11.100 --> 09:13.333
- [stammers]
- [结巴]

09:13.333 --> 09:14.467
Oh.
哦。

09:14.467 --> 09:16.733
Good luck on your retirement,
Plankton.
祝你退休生活好运，
浮游生物。

09:16.733 --> 09:18.867
I won't give you
any more trouble.
我不会给你
还有什么麻烦吗。

09:18.867 --> 09:20.833
- Oh, I know you won't, Krabs,
- 哦，我知道你不会的，蟹蟹，

09:20.833 --> 09:23.400
because I'm at
the Krusty Krab right now
因为我在
蟹堡王现在

09:23.400 --> 09:25.133
stealing that formula.
窃取那个公式。

09:25.133 --> 09:28.267
- Oh-oh, sure.
Whatever you say, old-timer.
- 哦哦，当然。
不管你说什么，老前辈。

09:28.267 --> 09:30.800
How would you be doing that when
you're all the way over here
当你这样做的时候你会怎么做
你就在这里

09:30.800 --> 09:33.133
in Dullsville, hmm?
在杜尔斯维尔，嗯？

09:33.133 --> 09:35.367
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:35.367 --> 09:39.400
Because I'm a decoy
look-alike robot!
因为我是一个诱饵
长得很像的机器人！

09:39.400 --> 09:42.700
Gotcha!
[laughs]
明白了！
[笑]

09:42.700 --> 09:44.667
- [sighs]
So what'd I miss?
- [叹气]
那么我错过了什么？

09:44.667 --> 09:45.833
both: What?
两人：什么？

09:45.833 --> 09:47.267
- That's right, Karen.
- 没错，凯伦。

09:47.267 --> 09:49.933
By the time those two
knuckleheads figure it out,
到时候那两个人
傻瓜们想明白了

09:49.933 --> 09:53.300
I'll be knee-deep
in secret formula.
我会齐膝深
在秘密公式中。

09:53.300 --> 09:56.433
Yes, I'll wear my galoshes.
Gotta go.
是的，我会穿上套鞋。
得走了。

09:56.433 --> 09:58.633
[straining]
[紧张]

09:58.633 --> 10:00.800
In your face, Krabs.
在你的脸上，蟹蟹。

10:00.800 --> 10:01.967
Ha!
哈!

10:05.300 --> 10:08.300
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

10:08.300 --> 10:10.000
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:10.000 --> 10:12.633
Krabs?
SpongeBoob?
螃蟹？
海绵布布？

10:12.633 --> 10:14.767
Why aren't you in Dullsville?
你为什么不在杜尔斯维尔？

10:14.767 --> 10:16.933
- We never left, Sheldon.
- 我们从未离开过，谢尔顿。

10:16.933 --> 10:20.133
The Mr. Krabs and SpongeBoob
who followed the robot you
蟹老板和海绵宝宝
谁跟踪了你的机器人

10:20.133 --> 10:24.167
to Dullsville
were also robots.
飞往杜尔斯维尔
也是机器人。

10:24.167 --> 10:27.033
Gotcha.
[laughs]
明白了。
[笑]

10:27.033 --> 10:29.867
- [grumbles]
Hate! Hate!
- [抱怨]
讨厌！恨！

10:29.867 --> 10:32.400
Hate! Hate! Hate!
Hate! Hate!
恨！恨！恨！
恨！恨！

10:35.400 --> 10:37.833
- So the way I see it,
Mr. Krabs and Plankton
- 所以在我看来，
蟹老板和浮游生物

10:37.833 --> 10:42.267
are just using us as pawns in
their dumb secret formula war.
只是利用我们作为棋子
他们愚蠢的秘密公式战争。

10:42.267 --> 10:43.433
- Agreed.
- 同意。

10:43.433 --> 10:45.800
- Yeah, I mean,
who cares if that guy
- 是的，我的意思是，
谁在乎那个家伙

10:45.800 --> 10:47.967
steals the secret
formula anyway?
窃取秘密
无论如何公式？

10:47.967 --> 10:50.267
Grow up, that's what I say.
长大吧，这就是我说的。

10:50.267 --> 10:51.367
- Agreed.
- 同意。

10:52.733 --> 10:56.433
- So you're the real
Krabs and SpongeBob.
- 所以你才是真正的
蟹蟹和海绵宝宝。

10:56.433 --> 10:57.500
Gimme that!
给我那个！

10:57.500 --> 10:58.833
- Ooh.
- [yells]
- 哦。
- [大喊]

10:58.833 --> 11:01.067
[all yelling, groaning]
[所有人大喊大叫，呻吟]

11:10.833 --> 11:12.733
[phone rings]
- Yello.
[电话铃声]
- 耶罗。

11:12.733 --> 11:14.200
Krusty Krab,
may I take your order?
蟹堡王,
我可以接受您的订单吗？

11:14.200 --> 11:16.467
No, Mr. Krabs is unable
to come to the phone right now.
不，蟹老板不能
现在就来接电话。

11:16.467 --> 11:18.333
He's trapped in
a dust cloud brawl.
他被困在
尘埃云斗殴。

11:18.333 --> 11:20.067
Yeah, he'll have
to call you back.
是的，他会有
给你回电。

11:20.067 --> 11:22.800
Gee, I hope our
robot look-alikes are okay.
哎呀，我希望我们的
机器人看起来很像还可以。

11:22.800 --> 11:25.067
Bless their heart-like
pneumatic pumps.
祝福他们如心如意
气动泵。

11:25.067 --> 11:28.200
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:28.200 --> 11:35.133
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

11:40.633 --> 11:42.767
all: Yay!
全体：耶！

全体：耶！